OL,3,AKnighting Sinfield 'easiest decision
OL,4,Aanyone's had to make,' says Prince
OL,5,AWilliam
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales has said awarding a
OL,8,Fknighthood to rugby league star Sir
OL,9,FKevin Sinfield "was probably the
OL,10,Feasiest decision anyone's ever had to
OL,11,Fmake".
OL,13,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast, Prince
OL,14,FWilliam spoke about his personal
OL,15,Fadmiration for Sir Kevin, who recently
OL,16,Fcompleted seven ultra marathons in
OL,17,Fseven days.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
